  "problem": "Find \n$|\\begin{aligned}a & 2 & 10 \\\\ 0 & b & 12 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 4\\end{aligned}|$\ngiven that \n$|\\begin{aligned}a & 2 \\\\ 0 & b\\end{aligned}|=-5.$",
